### Try it yourself

Change `training_hours_per_run = 12` and rerun — that's what
happens if you switch from an Isolation Forest to a gradient-boosted
ensemble that needs hyperparameter tuning. Or set `turbines = 2000`
to see how serving costs scale with fleet size.
